# 🤖 AI-Powered LinkedIn Content Engine with Human Approval

An automated end-to-end content creation and publishing pipeline built using **Make.com**, **Google Gemini AI**, **NewsAPI**, and **LinkedIn API**.

---

## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

### Scenario 1: Content Engine (Scheduler & AI Generation)
Generates topics, fetches relevant news, ranks articles using AI, writes a structured LinkedIn post, and sends an approval request email.

![Scenario 1 - Content Engine](scenario1-content-engine.png)

---

### Scenario 2: Approval Handler (Webhook & Publishing)
Listens for user approval/rejection via webhook links in the email. Validates against duplicate posts using an internal Data Store and publishes approved posts to LinkedIn.

![Scenario 2 - Approval Handler](scenario2-approval-handler.png)
